      "speaker_confidence": 0.86,
      "channel": "room",
      "text": "All of them resolve correctly now. Every single one lands within a hundred meters of the reference point. And I re-ran the US set too, to make sure the fix didn't break anything on the US side, and that's clean."
    },
    {
